      "player": "Sonnet Gramps",
      "decision_index": 89,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gran-Gran is a legendary creature, and GLM47 Coach already has a Gran-Gran on the battlefield. Casting a second Gran-Gran will cause the legend rule to apply, forcing the player to sacrifice one of the two copies. This wastes a card for essentially no benefit - at best, they get a single loot trigger from the new Gran-Gran becoming tapped (but it was just cast, so it won't tap unless they have a way to tap it). Meanwhile, they have Psychic Frog available to cast, which would be a much more impactful play as a 1/2 that can grow, gain flying, and draw cards on combat damage.",
      "action_taken": "Cast a second Gran-Gran while one was already on the battlefield, triggering the legend rule and wasting a card.",
