      "description": "Discarded Persist instead of the duplicate legendary Gran-Gran. The second Gran-Gran cannot be cast while the first is on the battlefield (legend rule would immediately kill one). Persist at least has future potential if creatures die - Emperor of Bones or Psychic Frog could become valid targets later.",
      "action_taken": "Discarded Persist to Psychic Frog's ability",
