    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Not attacking with Gran-Gran means missing a free loot trigger (draw + discard) since Gran-Gran draws a card when it becomes tapped. With 0 cards in hand, this card filtering is very valuable. Psychic Frog could also potentially sneak in for damage and a card draw if unblocked.",
