      "decision_index": 107,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "At 9 life against a board with Psychic Frog (which can pump and gain flying), declining to block Emperor of Bones drops to 5 life, putting them in lethal range. The Eldrazi Spawn token could chump block to save 4 life at minimal cost (sacrificing a 0/1 token), though preserving it for Emrakul mana is a consideration.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to block, taking 4 damage to go to 5 life",
